                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The Offer Comp Ratio is calculated by dividing the offered salary by the mid-range salary for the corresponding job profile(s). If there are multiple profiles, the average mid-range salary is used. To ensure accurate comparisons, all salaries are normalized to an annual basis, regardless of the frequency format used in the data (e.g., hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, etc.).</run>
